      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for these. i just ran them through the script and the score is okay, but honestly, some of these feel a little clunky. like, \"how did you leverage teamwork and a growth-mindset to achieve synergy\" feels a bit like a robot talking, if you know what i mean.\n\ncan you try again? i need them to feel more natural and conversational for the actual interviewers, but please make sure we still hit all those core themes so the script doesn't flag them as irrelevant. just try to bake the concepts in more naturally without it being so obvious.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
